        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuna ninche inkarn oo larikok Le Esau, te risioroto oo ilmareita lenye o manyishoritin enye anaa enatiu inkarn enye; ore ilarikok naa Timna, o Alifa o Yelet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Oholibama, o Ela, o Pinon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Kenas, o Tenan, o Mibsar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Magdiel, o Imran. Kulo ninche ilarikok le Edom (aa ninye eji Esau, menye le Edom), te risioroto oo manyishoritin enye teina kop nataa enenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.43"
            ]
